msgid ""
"Master switch. When off, the bound gesture and the Open Glimpse entry do "
"nothing – a quick way to silence Glimpse without unbinding its gesture."
msgstr ""
"Príomhlasc. Nuair atá sé as, ní dhéanann an gotha ceangailte ná an iontráil "
"Oscail Glimpse rud ar bith – bealach tapa chun Glimpse a chiúnú gan a ghotha"
" a dhícheangal."

msgid ""
"Assign or change it under Taps and gestures → Gesture manager → (pick a "
"gesture) → Reader → 'Open Glimpse'."
msgstr ""
"Sann nó athraigh é faoi Tapáil agus gothaí → Bainisteoir gothaí → (roghnaigh"
" gotha) → Léitheoir → 'Oscail Glimpse'."

msgid ""
"Browse the maps, family trees and other reference images found in this book,"
" without losing your reading position. Tip: bind the gesture action 'Open "
"Glimpse' for one-touch access."
msgstr ""
"Brabhsáil na léarscáileanna, na craobhacha ginealaigh agus na híomhánna "
"tagartha eile atá sa leabhar seo, gan do shuíomh léitheoireachta a "
"chailleadh. Leid: ceangail an gníomh gotha 'Oscail Glimpse' le haghaidh "
"rochtana aon-tadhaill."

msgid ""
"Also show the pages you've bookmarked (the dogear bookmark) in the Gallery, "
"rendered as page thumbnails and marked with a bookmark badge, in reading "
"order alongside the images – a quick way to keep a reference page a swipe "
"away. Off by default. Also available from the viewer's ⋯ menu (see Quick "
"Actions)."
msgstr ""
"Taispeáin sa Ghailearaí freisin na leathanaigh a leabharmharcáil tú (an "
"leabharmharc cluaise), léirithe mar mhionsamhlacha leathanaigh agus "
"marcáilte le suaitheantas leabharmhairc, in ord léitheoireachta in aice leis"
" na híomhánna – bealach tapa chun leathanach tagartha a choinneáil svaidhpe "
"amháin uait. As de réir réamhshocraithe. Ar fáil freisin ó roghchlár ⋯ an "
"amhairc (féach Gníomhartha Tapa)."

msgid ""
"Choose which actions appear in the viewer's ⋯ menu. Reset Rotation is "
"automatic (shown while an image is rotated)."
msgstr ""
"Roghnaigh na gníomhartha a thaispeántar i roghchlár ⋯ an amhairc. Tá "
"Athshocraigh Rothlú uathoibríoch (taispeántar é agus íomhá á rothlú)."

msgid ""
"Double-tap the image to jump to the maximum zoom (centered on the tap), and "
"again to return to the fitted view. On by default."
msgstr ""
"Tapáil faoi dhó ar an íomhá chun léim go dtí an tsúmáil uasta (dírithe ar an"
" tapa), agus arís chun filleadh ar an amharc oiriúnaithe. Ann de réir "
"réamhshocraithe."

msgid ""
"Swipe left or right across the image to move to the next or previous image. "
"On by default. (The Gallery's swipe-to-page is unaffected.)"
msgstr ""
"Svaidhpeáil ar chlé nó ar dheis trasna na híomhá chun bogadh go dtí an chéad"
" íomhá eile nó an íomhá roimhe. Ann de réir réamhshocraithe. (Ní chuirtear "
"isteach ar svaidhpeáil-go-leathanach an Ghailearaí.)"

msgid ""
"Pinch or spread two fingers on the image to zoom out or in. On by default."
msgstr ""
"Bain le chéile nó scaip dhá mhéar ar an íomhá chun súmáil amach nó isteach. "
"Ann de réir réamhshocraithe."

msgid ""
"Where Glimpse opens: a side panel (left or right) or, in portrait, a band "
"across the top or bottom. In landscape it always uses the preferred side."
msgstr ""
"Cá n-osclaíonn Glimpse: painéal taoibh (ar chlé nó ar dheis) nó, i "
"bpoirtréid, banda trasna an bharr nó an bhun. I dtírdhreach úsáideann sé an "
"taobh roghnaithe i gcónaí."

msgid ""
"How far you can zoom in, as a percentage of the image's own resolution. "
"Double-tap jumps to this level and pinch stops here. Higher reveals more on "
"detailed maps, but past 100% it is upscaling, so very high can look soft."
msgstr ""
"Cé chomh fada is féidir leat súmáil isteach, mar chéatadán de thaifeach na "
"híomhá féin. Léimeann tapáil dhúbailte go dtí an leibhéal seo agus stopann "
"baint le chéile anseo. Nochtann níos airde níos mó ar léarscáileanna "
"mionsonraithe, ach os cionn 100% is uas-scálú é, mar sin d'fhéadfadh an-ard "
"breathnú bog."

msgid ""
"Let the ‹ › buttons and swipes wrap around at the ends: Next on the last "
"image goes to the first, and Previous on the first goes to the last. The "
"Gallery pages wrap the same way."
msgstr ""
"Lig do na cnaipí ‹ › agus do na svaidhpeanna timfhilleadh ag na foircinn: "
"téann Ar Aghaidh ar an íomhá dheireanach go dtí an chéad cheann, agus téann "
"Siar ar an gcéad cheann go dtí an ceann deireanach. Timfhilleann leathanaigh"
" an Ghailearaí ar an mbealach céanna."

msgid ""
"Show ‹ and › buttons in the viewer for switching between images, as an "
"alternative to swiping. A button is grayed out when there is no image on its"
" side."
msgstr ""
"Taispeáin na cnaipí ‹ agus › san amharc chun athrú idir íomhánna, mar rogha "
"eile ar svaidhpeáil. Bíonn cnaipe liath nuair nach bhfuil aon íomhá ar a "
"thaobh."

msgid ""
"Show a vertical −/fit/+ control in the viewer for zooming in and out, as an "
"alternative to double-tap and pinch. The middle button returns to the fitted"
" view."
msgstr ""
"Taispeáin rialtán ingearach −/oiriúnaigh/+ san amharc chun súmáil isteach "
"agus amach, mar rogha eile ar thapáil dhúbailte agus ar bhaint le chéile. "
"Filleann an cnaipe láir ar an amharc oiriúnaithe."

msgid ""
"While zoomed in, show a small overview of the image with a rectangle marking"
" the visible area. Tap the map to jump there. It docks to the zoom controls "
"when those are on, and is hidden at the fitted view."
msgstr ""
"Agus tú súmáilte isteach, taispeáin forbhreathnú beag ar an íomhá le "
"dronuilleog a mharcálann an t-achar infheicthe. Tapáil an léarscáil chun "
"léim ann. Ceanglaíonn sé leis na rialtáin súmála nuair atá siad ann, agus "
"bíonn sé i bhfolach ag an amharc oiriúnaithe."

msgid ""
"While KOReader's night mode is on, show images inverted (light lines on a "
"dark background). Also toggleable from the viewer's ⋯ menu."
msgstr ""
"Agus mód oíche KOReader ar siúl, taispeáin íomhánna inbhéartaithe (línte "
"geala ar chúlra dorcha). Inscoradh freisin ó roghchlár ⋯ an amhairc."

msgid ""
"Show the image's caption from the book, overlaid in the viewer's top-left "
"corner."
msgstr ""
"Taispeáin foscríbhinn na híomhá ón leabhar, forleagtha i gcúinne uachtarach "
"ar chlé an amhairc."

msgid ""
"On a bookmarked page, show a label with the page number and chapter in the "
"viewer's top-left corner. Turn off to hide it."
msgstr ""
"Ar leathanach leabharmharcáilte, taispeáin lipéad le huimhir an leathanaigh "
"agus an chaibidil i gcúinne uachtarach ar chlé an amhairc. Múch chun é a "
"chur i bhfolach."

msgid ""
"Show the position as a compact \"3 / 42\" counter instead of a row of dots. "
"Useful when a book has so many images that the dots pill grows very wide. "
"Off by default. (With many images Glimpse switches to the counter on its "
"own; this makes it always so.)"
msgstr ""
"Taispeáin an suíomh mar chuntar dlúth \"3 / 42\" in ionad sraith poncanna. "
"Úsáideach nuair a bhíonn an oiread sin íomhánna i leabhar go n-éiríonn an "
"piolla poncanna an-leathan. As de réir réamhshocraithe. (Le go leor "
"íomhánna, athraíonn Glimpse chuig an gcuntar as a stuaim féin; fágann sé seo"
" i gcónaí é.)"

msgid ""
"On (default): while the viewer is open, a tap along the top edge opens "
"KOReader's top menu over the drawer, but only when KOReader itself opens its"
" menu on a tap (Settings → Taps and gestures → menu activation includes "
"Tap). Off: Glimpse keeps the top edge for itself, so a top tap never opens "
"the menu."
msgstr ""
"Ann (réamhshocrú): agus an t-amharcán oscailte, osclaíonn cnag feadh an "
"imill uachtair roghchlár uachtair KOReader os cionn an tarraiceáin, ach "
"amháin nuair a osclaíonn KOReader féin a roghchlár le cnag (Socruithe → "
"Cnaganna agus gothaí → cuimsíonn gníomhachtú an roghchláir Cnag). As: "
"coinníonn Glimpse an t-imeall uachtair dó féin, mar sin ní osclaíonn cnag ag"
" barr an roghchlár riamh."

msgid ""
"By default Glimpse sets aside covers, publisher logos, ornaments and other "
"non-reference imagery, keeping maps, family trees, diagrams and "
"illustrations. Enable this to switch that off and see every image in the "
"book. (Individual wrongly-kept images can instead be ignored from the "
"viewer's ⋯ menu; wrongly set-aside ones added back from the Gallery's "
"Ignored tab.)"
msgstr ""
"De réir réamhshocraithe cuireann Glimpse clúdaigh, lógónna foilsitheoirí, "
"ornáidí agus íomhánna neamhthagartha eile i leataobh, agus coinníonn sé "
"léarscáileanna, craobhacha ginealaigh, léaráidí agus léaráidí. Cumasaigh é "
"seo chun é sin a mhúchadh agus gach íomhá sa leabhar a fheiceáil. (Is féidir"
" neamhaird a dhéanamh d'íomhánna aonair a coinníodh go mícheart ó roghchlár "
"⋯ an amhairc ina ionad sin; na cinn a cuireadh i leataobh go mícheart a chur"
" ar ais ón gcluaisín Neamhairde sa Ghailearaí.)"

msgid ""
"Silence the message shown when Glimpse is opened on a book format it doesn't"
" support (PDF, comics, manga…). Handy if a reading gesture sometimes "
"triggers Glimpse on non-EPUB files. Off by default."
msgstr ""
"Ciúnaigh an teachtaireacht a thaispeántar nuair a osclaítear Glimpse ar "
"fhormáid leabhair nach dtacaíonn sé léi (PDF, greannáin, manga…). Áisiúil má"
" spreagann gotha léitheoireachta Glimpse uaireanta ar chomhaid neamh-EPUB. "
"As de réir réamhshocraithe."

msgid ""
"Remove the drawer's drop shadow. The shadow is a dithered gradient – the "
"main cause of e-ink ghosting behind the drawer – so turn it off if a ghost "
"lingers after closing Glimpse. No visible effect on LCD screens."
msgstr ""
"Bain scáth caite an tarraiceáin. Is grádán díthartha é an scáth – "
"príomhchúis taibhsiú e-ink taobh thiar den tarraiceán – mar sin múch é má "
"fhanann taibhse tar éis Glimpse a dhúnadh. Gan aon éifeacht infheicthe ar "
"scáileáin LCD."

msgid ""
"Switch between images with a quick, flashless refresh instead of a full "
"clear. On by default: faster and no flash. Turn it off if the previous image"
" ghosts through the next one – most noticeable on detailed maps and on "
"slower e-ink panels. No visible effect on LCD screens."
msgstr ""
"Athraigh idir íomhánna le hathnuachan tapa gan splanc in ionad glanadh "
"iomlán. Ann de réir réamhshocraithe: níos tapúla agus gan splanc. Múch é má "
"thaispeántar an íomhá roimhe tríd an gcéad cheann eile – is soiléire é ar "
"léarscáileanna mionsonraithe agus ar phainéil e-ink níos moille. Gan aon "
"éifeacht infheicthe ar scáileáin LCD."

msgid ""
"Glimpse caches its scan of the book. Use this if the book file was replaced "
"or images seem out of date."
msgstr ""
"Coinníonn Glimpse a scanadh den leabhar i dtaisce. Úsáid é seo má cuireadh "
"comhad an leabhair ina ionad nó má fheictear go bhfuil na híomhánna as dáta."

msgid ""
"Also offer releases marked as pre-release on GitHub – test builds published "
"before a proper release. Normal update checks never see those."
msgstr ""
"Tairg freisin eisiúintí atá marcáilte mar réamheisiúint ar GitHub – "
"tógálacha tástála a foilsíodh roimh eisiúint cheart. Ní fheiceann "
"gnáthsheiceálacha nuashonraithe iad seo riamh."

